WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-US

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.910
I hope you guys have a lot of energy&nbsp;today,

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:05.720
because we're about to wiggle like crazy!

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:08.092
First, we're gonna wiggle 
like&nbsp;some wiggly things.

00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:09.879
Are you ready? Let's go!

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
First, wiggle like an earthworm

00:00:13.301 --> 00:00:14.672
Digging in the dirt

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:19.092
Now wiggle like confetti

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.427
Falling from the sky

00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:25.416
Then wiggle like seaweed

00:00:26.289 --> 00:00:28.171
Down deep in the ocean

00:00:29.401 --> 00:00:31.882
Now wiggle like Jell-O

00:00:32.703 --> 00:00:34.016
Shaking in a bowl

00:00:35.935 --> 00:00:37.668
Can you wiggle fast?
Can you wiggle slow?

00:00:37.668 --> 00:00:39.232
Can you wiggle high?
Can you wiggle low?

00:00:39.232 --> 00:00:41.523
Now stand up straight and STOP!

00:00:41.616 --> 00:00:42.879
Do the wiggle dance!

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:46.068
Wig-Wiggle!

00:00:48.134 --> 00:00:49.572
Do the wiggle dance!

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.854
Wig-Wig-Wig-Wiggle!

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:55.637
Do the wiggle dance!

00:00:55.637 --> 00:00:57.947
Okay, now let's wiggle different parts of our&nbsp;bodies!

00:00:57.947 --> 00:00:58.856
But here's the trick...

00:00:58.856 --> 00:01:01.481
Once a part of you is wiggling, 
you gotta keep it wiggling!

00:01:01.481 --> 00:01:03.501
You think you&nbsp;can keep up? 
Let's try!

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:05.983
First, wiggle your right arm

00:01:06.674 --> 00:01:09.323
Now wiggle your left arm

00:01:09.828 --> 00:01:12.063
Then wiggle your knees

00:01:13.101 --> 00:01:15.630
Now wiggle your head!

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:18.000
Can you wiggle fast?
Can you wiggle slow?

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.549
Can you wiggle high?
Can you wiggle low?

00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:21.938
Now stand up straight and STOP!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.103
Do the wiggle dance!

00:01:25.201 --> 00:01:26.271
Wig-Wiggle!

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:29.516
Do the wiggle dance!

00:01:31.401 --> 00:01:32.663
Wig-Wig-Wig-Wiggle!

00:01:34.996 --> 00:01:36.148
Do the wiggle dance!

00:01:36.148 --> 00:01:37.407
Now, come in close! 
Come in close!

00:01:37.407 --> 00:01:38.373
There we go! That's&nbsp;good.

00:01:38.373 --> 00:01:40.729
So, now we're gonna do some tiny wiggles!

00:01:40.729 --> 00:01:41.950
You ready?

00:01:42.329 --> 00:01:44.213
Can you wiggle your pinkies?

00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:47.678
Can you wiggle your eyebrows?

00:01:48.668 --> 00:01:50.703
Can you wiggle your eyes?

00:01:52.222 --> 00:01:54.037
Now, how about your lips?

